  "rhythm": "Twitch owner credit: Acry. Songsterr Steve Ouimette Guitar Hero III score 91629 revision 4962876 supplies 300 BPM and the lead, bass, rhythm guitars, and kit. The arrangement keeps measures 5-19, then jumps over the repeated low guitar chug to measures 149-158 for a varied lead solo. The 16th-note chromatic run in the first section and quick solo ornaments are sampled on playable onsets to preserve tempo; pitches outside ocarina range are octave folded. The entire arrangement is moved -1 semitones by the builder. Church organ and pizzicato strings represent the distorted guitars using available OoT programs.",
